  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Fish_Fillet?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"> <figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fish fillet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Fish fillet</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal good</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 27</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 54</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  Instant</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 4 to 20</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Fish</span><span title=\"Fish\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"58\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 15</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Varies upon location</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Fish fillets</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/animal-goods-7457\" title=\"Animal Goods\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animal goods</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 27.\n</p><p>They are used to make various products (pizzas, tacos, soup,...).\n</p><p>Like all goods, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Collecting fish fillets</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Sockeye_Salmon.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711153706\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"129\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Fish</figcaption></figure><p> Fish fillets are collected from <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a> that have been caught in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing lake</a>. If players use <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a> to catch fish fillets can be yielded in a few seconds; however, that fishing spot can't be used for a period of time, based on the spot, for 2 to 4 hours. If players use <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-net-16888\" title=\"Fishing Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nets</a> they get 3 fillets after 20 hours.\n</p><p>Collecting a fillet gives players between 4 and 20 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> points, depending on the type of fish they caught.\n</p><p>Note that fish cannot be caught using <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. Players have to play the mini-game when catching them with lures, or they have to use nets.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling fish fillets</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside Shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Fish fillet can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 540 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 pieces.</li>\n<li>Making red <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-net-16888\" title=\"Fishing Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nets</a> to catch fish requires no material and does not cost anything. Making other types of lure requires <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using fish fillets</b></span></h3>\n<p>Fish fillets are used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/fish-burger-5873\" title=\"Fish burger\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish burger\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/fish-pie-5877\" title=\"Fish pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/meat-bucket-35188\" title=\"Meat bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Meat bucket\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/fish-burger-5873\" title=\"Fish Burger\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish Burger</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/fish-pie-5877\" title=\"Fish Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish Pie</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/meat-bucket-35188\" title=\"Meat Bucket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Meat Bucket</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 27\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 28\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 34 (First Arctic <a href=\"/wiki/fox-35216\" title=\"Fox\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fox</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/fish-and-chips-7182\" title=\"Fish and chips\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish and chips\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/frutti-di-mare-pizza-8450\" title=\"Frutti di mare pizza\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Frutti di mare pizza\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/fish-soup-8448\" title=\"Fish soup\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish soup\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/fish-and-chips-7182\" title=\"Fish and Chips\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish and Chips</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/frutti-di-mare-pizza-8450\" title=\"Frutti di Mare Pizza\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Frutti di Mare Pizza</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/fish-soup-8448\" title=\"Fish Soup\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish Soup</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x2</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 41\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 45\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 53\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/sushi-roll-8913\" title=\"Sushi roll\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sushi roll\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/seafood-salad-8948\" title=\"Seafood salad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Seafood salad\" loading=\"lazy\" width=