target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 76\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 79\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 79\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/canned-fish-35179\" title=\"Canned fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Canned fish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/fish-skewer-31934\" title=\"Fish skewer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish skewer\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/canned-fish-35179\" title=\"Canned Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Canned Fish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/fish-skewer-31934\" title=\"Fish Skewer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish Skewer</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/63/Fish_Fillet.png/revision/latest?cb=20150414211348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Fillet\" load